<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">About This Theme</h3>
<p class="mb-4">Ashton is a modern and minimalist Ghost theme designed for bloggers and content creators who want to showcase their work in a clean and elegant way. With a focus on readability and simplicity, Ashton provides a seamless reading experience for your audience.</p>
<h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Key Features</h4>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-4">
    <li>Responsive Design: Looks great on all devices, from desktops to mobile phones.</li>
    <li>Customizable Layouts: Multiple layout options to choose from for your homepage and posts.</li>
    <li>Dark Mode: Built-in dark mode for a comfortable reading experience in low-light environments.</li>
    <li>SEO Optimized: Designed with best SEO practices in mind to help your content rank higher in search engines.</li>
    <li>Fast Loading: Optimized for speed to ensure quick load times for your visitors.</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Getting Started</h4>
<p class="mb-4">To get started with the Ashton theme, simply download the theme files and upload them to your Ghost installation via the Admin panel. Once activated, you can customize the theme settings to match your brand and style preferences.</p>
<h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Support & Documentation</h4>
<p class="mb-4">For detailed documentation and support, please visit the <a href="https://example.com/ashton-theme-docs" class="text-blue-600 underline">Ashton Theme Documentation</a> page. If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
<p>Thank you for choosing the Ashton theme! We hope it helps you create a beautiful and engaging online presence.</p>